        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "XVFsCk",
          "name": "The admin console’s own desi",
          "content": "The admin console’s own design system (apps/admin), separate from the player’s library and drawn after the admin prototype (pencil/web-admin-design/prototype). Glass surfaces over a soft aurora; colours are the code’s tokens in three themes (Light, Dark, Dim); admin screens import this file as `admin` and use only its components. Source: scripts/pencil-pages/admin-lib.mjs.",
